<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-θετικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>adding: repletive</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφαιρετικός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.8.2
			</span></i>; <i>giving additional power, furthering</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις π. εἰς τὸ τίκτειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>; <i>nutritive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοηθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					14.694
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, θεραπεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				5.129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astron.,
				<i>advancing</i>, of planets, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμικύκλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Alm.</u>
					13.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>G.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπὴ -ωτέρα</span>
			<i>adding heat to the sun</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσθεσις</span> vi), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Leid.W.</u>
				10.14
			</span></i>.</div>
